# Lean agent context

- Do not create or restore root `AGENTS.md` inside `.agents/skills/*` — Cursor injects those every turn. Put long guides in `reference/` and load on demand.
- Load at most one skill body per task; open only the specific `rules/` or `reference/` file needed.
- Prefer Grep and bounded Read (offset/limit) over whole-file or whole-tree dumps.
- Keep tool stdout small; write large artifacts to disk and summarize.
- Keep replies short; skip restating the task or dumping skill text.
- Prefer a fresh chat when switching topics (history is re-sent every turn).
